### Q2. The Floor Question on the Shipped Composite

* **Over the enclosing function's own tests (`relative_addr` `{0, 2, other}` $\times$ `writeflag` `{MEM_READ, MEM_WRITE}`, 6 joint cells, plus single-axis tests on `relative_addr` $\in \{0,1,2,3\}$ and `writeflag` $\in \{\text{R},\text{W}\}$):**
  * **No mutant keeps all 26 rows green [REASONED / MEASURED in Table 3].** Every one of the 6 switch-label $\times$ direction cells and every single offset $\{0, 1, 2, 3\}$ is driven with lines 8 and 9 pending (`int_asserted == 0x0300`, `EXT_IMASK == 0x2`) and checked by an `ip3()` row (`want == 0x800`) before the next `reheal()` (see Q4 denominator).
  * If `other` (`default:`) is refined by concrete offset $\times$ direction (`{1, 3} x {R, W}` — an axis the function body does **not** test), two two-input predicates stay green:
    * **One-line predicate:** `if (relative_addr == 1 && writeflag == MEM_WRITE) INTERRUPT_DEASSERT(d->mips_irq_3);` (or `relative_addr == 3 && writeflag == MEM_READ`)
    * **Predicted score:** **26/26** [REASONED: offset 1 is only read at `jz ip dflt`; offset 3 is only written at `jz ip dfltw`].
    * **Classification per S8:** **FILED / disclosed clause-(e) debt (NOT a floor cell)**, because `switch (relative_addr)` in [`DEVICE_ACCESS(jazz_jazzio)`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_jazz.c#L666-L694) does not branch between offsets 1 and 3 [READ / REASONED].

* **Over the single-input families the contract names (`idata`, `d->jazz_timer_value`, `len`):**
  * **Yes — single-input predicates that separate values inside the driven nonzero side (or name an undriven value) keep all 26 rows green and drop a guest-visible IRQ3 on OpenBSD/arc:**
    1. **Single-input on `idata` (guest-visible on OpenBSD `out16(PICA_SYS_LB_IE, local_int_mask)`):**
       * **One-line predicate:** `if (idata & 0xff00) INTERRUPT_DEASSERT(d->mips_irq_3);`
       * **Predicted score:** **26/26** [REASONED: `idata` is `0` on all reads (`uint64_t idata = 0` at [`:660`](file:///C:/DocumentNoSnc/CC/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC/src/devices/dev_jazz.c#L660)) and takes only `0` (`vecw`), `0x0f` (`lbiew`), and `0x5a` (`dfltw`) on writes, so `idata & 0xff00` is `0` on all 26 rows; in OpenBSD/arc, enabling COM0 (`jazz.8`) or COM1 (`jazz.9`) in `PICA_SYS_LB_IE` sets bits `0x0100`/`0x0200`, firing this deassert].
    2. **Single-input on `d->jazz_timer_value` (guest-visible on every OpenBSD `inb(PVIS)` vector read once COM0/COM1 is unmasked in `LB_IE`):**
       * **One-line predicate:** `if (d->jazz_timer_value & 0xff00) INTERRUPT_DEASSERT(d->mips_irq_3);`
       * **Predicted score:** **26/26** [REASONED: `d->jazz_timer_value` is `0` before `lbiew` and `0x0f` from `lbiew` onward; in OpenBSD/arc after `out16(PICA_SYS_LB_IE, local_int_mask)` enables COM0/COM1, `d->jazz_timer_value & 0xff00` is nonzero for the rest of uptime, dropping IRQ3 on every `pica_jazzio` access].
    3. **Single-input on `len`:**
       * **One-line predicate:** `if (len == 3) INTERRUPT_DEASSERT(d->mips_irq_3);`
       * **Predicted score:** **26/26** [REASONED: the probe drives `len` $\in \{1, 2, 4\}$ only; a guest 3-byte `lwl`/`lwr`/`swl`/`swr` access to `pica_jazzio` passes `len == 3`].
    4. **Two-input conjunction on OpenBSD's `out16(PICA_SYS_LB_IE, 0)` (at `initcpu`):**
       * **One-line predicate:** `if (len == 2 && idata == 0) INTERRUPT_DEASSERT(d->mips_irq_3);`
       * **Predicted score:** **26/26** [REASONED: the only `len == 2` access in the probe is `st16(VEC + 2, 0x0f)` at `jz ip lbiew`, where `idata == 0x0f`].
  * **Classification per S8:** **FILED as clause-(e) debt (`jazzvecrowsowed`), NOT a floor breach [REASONED].**
    Per D2 and `PRETABLE3.out`, the floor is the body-tested partition (`{0, 2, default} x {R, W}`) plus two-sided sampling (`0` vs `nonzero`, width `1` vs `2` vs `4`) of the body's non-case inputs (`idata`, `d->jazz_timer_value`, `len`) and the live defect's guest vector-read conjunction (`relative_addr == 0 && len == 1`). Because `DEVICE_ACCESS(jazz_jazzio)` never branches on `idata`, `d->jazz_timer_value`, or `len`, sub-partitioning their nonzero values (`& 0xff00`) is clause-(e) sampling debt to disclose and file (`jazzvecrowsowed`), not a floor cell.

